      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "б) $1^2-2^2+3^2-4^2+\\cdots+(-1)^{n-1}n^2↵=(-1)^{n-1}\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "23",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$23^*$. а) $\\frac{1}{1\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times9}+\\frac{1}{9\\times13}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{(4n-3)(4n+1)}↵=\\frac{n}{4n+1}$；",
        "б) $\\frac{1}{1\\times3\\times5}+\\frac{2}{3\\times5\\times7}+\\cdots+\\frac{n}{(2n-1)(2n+1)(2n+3)}↵=\\frac{n(n+1)}{2(2n+1)(2n+3)}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "24",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$24^*$. 分布在同一平面上的$n$条直线，每两条互不平行，每三",
        "条不交于一个点. 证明它们将平面划分成$1+\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$个",
        "区域."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "25",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$25^*$. 有$n$个平面，每两个平面互不平行，每三个不交于一条",
        "直线，每四个不通过同一个点，这些平面的交线，每两条",
        "互不平行. 证明它们将整个空间划分成",
        "$\\frac{(n+1)(n^2-n+6)}{6}$",
        "个区域."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "26",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$26^*$. 证明：分布在一个平面上的$n$个圆将整个平面划分成",
        "不多于$n^2-n+2$个区域."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于任意一个自然数$n$，证明（27—28题）："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "27",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "27. а) $6^{2n-1}+1$是$7$的倍数；",
        "б) $4^n+15n-1$是$9$的倍数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "28",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "28. а) $10^n+18n-28$是$27$的倍数；"
      ]
